{"h":"<h3>CFG:1，4 steps.</h3><h3>CFG:1.5，5~8 steps.</h3><p>--</p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/willmiao/ComfyUI-Lora-Manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>劳拉经理</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill/blob/main/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI</strong></a><strong>洛拉。</strong></p><p><strong>将Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI lora的lora权重设定为1。</strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>下载</strong><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://github.com/willmiao/ComfyUI-Lora-Manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>劳拉经理</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p><p><strong>下载</strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill/blob/main/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI</strong></a><strong>洛拉。</strong></p><p><strong>Set the lora weight of Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI lora to 1.</strong></p><p><strong>(This workflow \"ZImageTurbo\" can also be used, just don't add Turbo Lora.)</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>yolov9c.pt</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/blob/main/face_yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/blob/main/face_yolov9c.pt</strong></a></p><p><strong>将face_</strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>yolov9c.pt</strong></a><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Gourieff/ReActor/blob/main/models/sams/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth</strong></a></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>ComfyUI 冲击包</strong></a><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lokCX/4x-Ultrasharp/blob/main/4x-UltraSharp.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>4x-Ultrasharp</strong></a><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>Install the missing nodes first.</strong></p><p><strong>Download face_</strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>yolov9c.pt</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/blob/main/face_yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/blob/main/face_yolov9c.pt</strong></a></p><p><strong>Place face_</strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>yolov9c.pt</strong></a><strong>in the following path:ComfyUI\\models\\ultralytics\\bbox</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>下载</strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Gourieff/ReActor/blob/main/models/sams/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong>sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth</strong></a></p><p><strong>Place sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth in the following path: ComfyUI\\models\\sams</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>If the facial repair function is ineffective, the \"guide size\" number needs to be increased.</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>If you encounter an error during the installation of \"FaceDetailer\", please refer to the tutorial in \"</strong><a href=\"https://githu