Turbo\"也可使用，只需不要添加Turbo lora.)</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong></strong><strong></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/willmiao/ComfyUI-Lora-Manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill/blob/main/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-4-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>先安裝缺失的節點.</strong></p><p><strong>下載face_</strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/blob/main/face_yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a></p><p><strong></strong><a href=\"http://yolov9c.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a><strong>放入以下路徑:ComfyUI\\models\\ultralytics\\bbox</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>下載</strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Gourieff/ReActor/blob/main/models/sams/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a></p><p><strong>將sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth放入以下路徑:ComfyUI\\models\\sams</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>如果面部修復功能沒有生效時，需提高\"guide size\"的數字.</strong></p><p><strong>\"FaceDetailer\"安裝有錯誤時，請參考\"</strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a><strong>\"中的教學.</strong></p><p><strong>--</strong></p><p><strong>四倍放大圖片需下載</strong><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lokCX/4x-Ultrasharp/blob/main/4x-UltraSharp.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong></strong></a><strong>,並將它放入以下路徑: ComfyUI\\models\\upscale_models</strong></p><p><strong>“放大 latent 空間”中的”去雜訊強度”數字越大整題構圖的改變將會越大。</strong></p><